# Data integrations

- Keep privileged Google Sheets, CMS, CRM, database, and AI credentials outside client bundles.
- Map external records into validated domain objects in one adapter rather than spreading source-column assumptions through UI code.
- Define freshness, caching, timeout, fallback, and observability deliberately.
- Show operational value through a truthful workflow or demonstration. Do not confuse a front-end demo with a live production integration.
- Avoid logging secrets or sensitive customer data.
